      "finding": "22 of 23 sections contain exactly 18 focuses, every section exactly two mutually exclusive pairs. Twelve sections have exactly the same ordered prerequisite/exclusion graph, irrespective of geometry. Their recurring pattern is root, two two-step choice arms, merge, another two two-step arms, merge, three two-step collectible spurs, finale. The overview visibly resembles repeated stamps.",
      "proposal": "Keep all historically supported parties. Stop enforcing equal counts: combine small administration cards with the policy they implement; give major political choices separate three- or four-card developments; retain shared economic projects beside those choices. Do not compact by deleting alternate governments or forcing global fixed widths.",
